   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:19:54,412:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 1.1.2 Engagement-Driven vs. Credibility-Driven Systems |
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:19:54,412:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 3 |
