   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:19:57,497:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: The total evidence mass is simply N = S⁺ + S⁻.
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:19:57,497:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Bayesian Credibility
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:19:57,498:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Given the accumulated evidence, the Bayesian credibility uses conjugate Beta updating:
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:19:57,498:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: $$C
