   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:19:58,341:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 0.05, 0.15
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:19:58,341:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ]
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:19:58,341:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ,
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:19:58,342:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: deliberately vote incorrectly |
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:19:58,342:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:19:58,343:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | Bot Users | 20 | p = 0.10, organized in 4 coordinated groups of 5 |
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:19:58,343:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:19:58,344:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | Total Posts | 50 |
