   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:19:58,348:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Location | Delhi (28.6139°N, 77.2090°E) | Geographic center of simulation |
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:19:58,348:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
