   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,450:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: APPENDIX C
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,450:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: SETUP AND EXECUTION GUIDE
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,451:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: This appendix provides instructions for setting up and running the NCPS platform on a local development
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,452:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: environment.
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,453:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: C.1 Prerequisites
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,453:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Ensure the following software is installed:
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,454:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,455:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Python
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,455:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  3.10 or higher
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,456:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,457:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Node.js
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,457:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  18+ and npm 9+
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,458:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,459:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: PostgreSQL
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,459:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  14+
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,460:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,461:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Git
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,461:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  for version control
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,462:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: C.2 Backend Setup
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,462:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # 1. Clone the repository
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,463:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: git clone https://github.com/Niteshkrjhag/NCPS.git
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,463:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: cd NCPS
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,464:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # 2. Create a Python virtual environment
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,464:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: python3 -m venv venv
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,464:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: source venv/bin/activate    # Linux/macOS
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,465:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # or: venv\Scripts\activate  # Windows
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,465:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # 3. Install backend dependencies
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,465:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: pip install -r requirements.txt
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,466:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # 4. Configure environment variables
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,466:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: cp .env.example .env
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,466:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # Edit .env with your PostgreSQL credentials:
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,467:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: #   DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/ncps_db
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,467:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: #   SECRET_KEY=your-secret-key-here
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,468:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: #   ALGORITHM=HS256
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,468:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: #   ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=1440
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,468:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: C.3 Database Setup
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,469:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # 1. Create the PostgreSQL database
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,469:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: createdb ncps_db
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,469:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # 2. Initialize database schema
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,470:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # The application auto-creates tables on first run via SQLAlchemy
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,470:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: python -c "from backend.app.database import engine, Base;
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,471:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Base.metadata.create_all(bind=engine)"
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,471:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: C.4 Backend Execution
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,472:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # Start the FastAPI server
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,472:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: cd backend
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,472:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: uvicorn app.main:app --reload --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,473:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # The API is now accessible at http://localhost:8000
   DEBUG: 2026-06-01 02:20:00,473:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # API documentation at http://localhost:8000/docs (Swagger UI)
